pyq_focus = [
 "Drama unit se NET har baar 8-12 sawal tak puchta hai, isliye ye sabse scoring unit hai.",
 "Sabse zyada sawal author-work matching par aate hain: kaun sa play kisne likha (Jacobean, Restoration, American, Indian).",
 "Chronology bahut aati hai: 4 plays ko saal ke order mein lagana. Har bade play ka saal yaad karo, kam se kam decade.",
 "Characters se play pehchanna: Mosca, Bosola, Millamant, Mrs Malaprop, Jimmy Porter, Blanche, Willy Loman, Leela Benare.",
 "Famous lines ka speaker aur play: Shakespeare, Webster, Congreve, Wilde, Beckett, Williams ki lines baar baar aati hain.",
 "Terms aur unke coiner: catharsis, objective correlative, comedy of menace, Theatre of the Absurd, alienation effect, in-yer-face.",
 "Assertion-Reason mein Aristotle, Brecht, Absurd theatre, sentimental comedy aur Licensing Act jaise topics aate hain.",
 "Taiyari: pehle 'easy' story padho, phir works list aur people list ko flashcard ki tarah 3-4 baar dohrao, phir 100 MCQ lagao.",
 "Indian drama (Karnad, Tendulkar, Sircar, Dattani) aur Nobel winner dramatists (Shaw, O'Neill, Beckett, Soyinka, Pinter) ko alag se pakka karo."
]

easy = [
 ("Greek Tragedy and Aristotle's Poetics",
  "Socho purane Athens mein Dionysus devta ka bada mela lagta tha, bilkul hamari Ramlila jaisa. Wahan Aeschylus, Sophocles aur Euripides apne dukh bhare natak dikhate the. Hero bada aadmi hota tha, par ek galti (hamartia) ki wajah se gir jata tha, jaise Oedipus. Achanak kismat palat jati (peripeteia) aur hero ko sach pata chalta (anagnorisis). Dekhne wale ko daya aur dar mehsoos hota, phir dil halka ho jata - isko catharsis kehte hain. Aristotle ne Poetics mein ye sab niyam likh diye aur kaha ki plot natak ki aatma hai.",
  "'Aaj Sabko Exam' = Aeschylus, Sophocles, Euripides (purane se naye). Actor gino: Aeschylus ne 2nd actor joda, Sophocles ne 3rd - S matlab 'Sabse zyada' actors."),
 ("Greek and Roman Comedy; Seneca",
  "Tragedy ke saath Greece mein hasi wale natak bhi the. Aristophanes bade netaon aur Socrates ka mazaak udate the, jaise aaj ke comedy shows. Baad mein Menander ne ghar-parivaar wali comedy likhi. Rome mein Plautus aur Terence ne yahi style apnayi, aur Shakespeare ne Plautus se Comedy of Errors banayi. Seneca ke natak khoon, bhoot aur badle se bhare the, jaise purani masala film. Elizabethan revenge tragedy isi Seneca se nikli.",
  "'Aristophanes = Aaj ki Satire' (Clouds mein Socrates ka mazaak). 'Plautus ke Twins = Comedy of Errors'. 'Seneca = Sirf Khoon aur Bhoot'."),
 ("Medieval English Drama",
  "Purane England mein natak church se shuru hua, jaise mandir mein katha. Easter par 'Quem Quaeritis' (kise dhoondh rahe ho?) wala chhota sa dialogue gaya jata tha. Phir Bible ki kahaniyan gaon ke karigar (guilds) gaadiyon par dikhane lage - ye Mystery plays the. Morality plays mein achchai aur buraai insaan ban kar aate the, jaise Everyman mein Death, Good Deeds. Everyman ka saath maut tak sirf Good Deeds deta hai, dost aur paisa nahi. Phir Ralph Roister Doister aur Gorboduc se asli English comedy aur tragedy shuru hui.",
  "'Maut ke time sirf achhe karam saath jaate hain' = Everyman + Good Deeds. 'Ralph Roya, Gorboduc Gaya': pehli comedy (Udall) aur pehli blank verse tragedy (1561)."),
 ("University Wits, Kyd and Marlowe",
  "Shakespeare se pehle Oxford-Cambridge se padhe kuch hoshiyaar ladke London aaye aur natak likhne lage - inhe University Wits kehte hain. Inme sabse bada star Marlowe tha, jisne blank verse ko taaqatwar banaya. Uska Doctor Faustus apni aatma shaitan ko 24 saal ke liye bech deta hai, jaise koi shortcut ke liye sab kuch daav par laga de. Kyd ki The Spanish Tragedy ne badle wale natak ka trend shuru kiya. Greene ne jalan mein Shakespeare ko 'upstart crow' keh diya.",
  "Wits ke naam: 'Lyly Peele Greene, Lodge Nashe Marlowe' - 'LPG Lo Na Mar'. Marlowe ke 4 hero: Tamburlaine, Faustus, Barabas, Edward - 'TFBE: Taaqat, Faustus, Bania, Edward'."),
 ("Shakespeare",
  "Shakespeare English ke sabse bade natakkaar hain, jaise Hindi mein Premchand kahani ke. Unhone comedy, history, tragedy aur romance sab likhe. Char badi tragedies hain Hamlet, Othello, King Lear aur Macbeth - har hero ki ek kamzori use dubo deti hai. Unke marne ke baad 1623 mein dost Heminges aur Condell ne First Folio chhapa. Globe Theatre unka 'ghar' tha. Critics jaise Johnson, Coleridge, Bradley aur Eliot ne unpar bahut likha.",
  "Badi 4 tragedies: 'HOLM' = Hamlet, Othello, Lear, Macbeth (likhne ka order bhi yahi). Last romances: 'Pehle Cymbal bajao, Winter mein Tempest' = Pericles, Cymbeline, Winter's Tale, Tempest."),
 ("Jacobean and Caroline Drama",
  "James I ke time (Jacobean) ke natak andhere, khooni aur chalaak logon se bhare the. Ben Jonson ne 'humours' wali comedy likhi, jahan har kirdaar ek hi aadat ka gulaam hota hai, jaise koi sirf paise ka bhooka. Volpone mein sab kirdaaron ke naam jaanwaron par hain - lomdi, makkhi, giddh. Webster ki Duchess of Malfi ko uske hi bhai maarwa dete hain. Middleton, Ford, Tourneur ne bhi badle aur paap ke natak likhe. 1642 mein Puritans ne saare theatre band kar diye.",
  "Volpone = 'Fox ka Zoo': Volpone fox, Mosca fly, Voltore vulture, Corbaccio raven, Corvino crow. 'Webster = Death ka Master' (skull beneath the skin)."),
 ("Restoration Drama (1660-1700)",
  "1660 mein Charles II wapas aaye aur theatre phir se khul gaye, bilkul lockdown ke baad mall khulne jaisa. Ab pehli baar auraton ne stage par acting ki. Comedies mein London ke ameer, chalaak, flirt karne wale log the - isko comedy of manners kehte hain. Congreve ki The Way of the World mein Mirabell aur Millamant shaadi se pehle apni shartein (proviso scene) rakhte hain. Dryden ne heroic drama likha jisme pyaar aur izzat ki ladai hoti thi. 1698 mein Jeremy Collier ne in natakon ko gande keh kar attack kiya.",
  "Comedy of manners ke 5: 'Every Wise Cat Visits Farms' = Etherege, Wycherley, Congreve, Vanbrugh, Farquhar. Collier 1698 = '98 mein Collier ne Chaar (charge) lagaya'."),
 ("Eighteenth-Century Drama",
  "18vi sadi mein log rona-dhona aur seekh wali 'sentimental comedy' pasand karne lage, jaise purani family TV serial. Goldsmith aur Sheridan ne iske khilaaf asli hasi wali 'laughing comedy' wapas laayi. She Stoops to Conquer mein Marlow ek ghar ko galti se hotel samajh leta hai. Sheridan ki Mrs Malaprop galat shabd bolti hai, isse 'malapropism' bana. John Gay ki The Beggar's Opera chor-dakuon ke gaanon wala natak tha. Fielding ke tikhe natakon se 1737 ka Licensing Act aaya aur censorship shuru hui.",
  "'Sheridan ke 3 S': Scandal (School for Scandal), Sneerwell, Surface brothers. 'Goldsmith ne 1773 mein Stoop kiya' = She Stoops to Conquer + Essay on the Theatre, dono 1773."),
 ("Nineteenth-Century Drama: Romantics to Wilde and Shaw",
  "Romantic kavi (Shelley, Byron) ne natak likhe par ye padhne layak zyada the, stage ke kam - closet drama. Stage par melodrama ka raaj tha, jaise purani Bollywood masala. Phir Oscar Wilde aaye, jinke natak chatpate jumlon se bhare the - The Importance of Being Earnest sabse mashhoor. Bernard Shaw ne Ibsen se seekh kar samaaj ki buraiyon par sawaal uthaye, jaise paisa, garibi, aurat ki haalat. Pygmalion mein Professor Higgins phool bechne wali Eliza ko 'lady' banata hai. Shaw ko 1925 mein Nobel mila.",
  "Wilde ke 4 comedies 'Lady Woman Ideal Earnest' (Fan 1892 se Earnest 1895). Shaw ka 'P.S.' = Pygmalion 1913, Saint Joan 1923 - dono ke beech 10 saal."),
 ("Modern and Contemporary British Drama",
  "20vi sadi mein T. S. Eliot ne kavita wale natak wapas laaye, jaise Murder in the Cathedral. 1956 mein Osborne ka Look Back in Anger aaya - Jimmy Porter gussa karne wala naujawan, jaise berozgar beta ghar mein sab par chilla raha ho. Pinter ke natakon mein chupi dhamki aur lambe pause hote hain - comedy of menace. Stoppard ne Hamlet ke do chhote kirdaaron ko hero bana diya. Caryl Churchill ne aurat aur paise ke sawaal uthaye. 1990s mein Sarah Kane jaise lekhakon ka 'in-yer-face' theatre aaya.",
  "'8 May 1956 = Angry Day' (Look Back in Anger). Pinter ke 'B-C-H-B': Birthday Party, Caretaker, Homecoming, Betrayal - order mein."),
 ("Irish Drama",
  "Ireland ne apni pehchaan dikhane ke liye apna theatre banaya - Abbey Theatre, Dublin (1904). Yeats, Lady Gregory aur Synge iske neta the. Synge ke Riders to the Sea mein ek maa Maurya ke saare bete samundar le leta hai. Playboy of the Western World par 1907 mein dange ho gaye. O'Casey ne Dublin ke gareeb logon ki teen kahaniyan likhi. Beckett bhi Irish the, aur Brian Friel ne Translations mein bhasha aur angrezi raaj ka dard dikhaya.",
  "O'Casey trilogy 'Gun-Juno-Plough' = 1923-24-26. 'Synge ka Sea aur Playboy: 1904 mein rona, 1907 mein danga'."),
 ("American Drama",
  "America ka asli natak Eugene O'Neill se shuru hua, jinhe 1936 mein Nobel mila. Tennessee Williams ne toote sapno wale logon ki kahani likhi - Blanche aur Laura jaise naazuk kirdaar. Arthur Miller ka Willy Loman ek salesman hai jo 'success' ke peeche bhaagte bhaagte toot jata hai, jaise EMI mein phansa aam aadmi. The Crucible mein chudailon ke jhoothe case dikha kar McCarthy ke daur par chot ki. Albee, Hansberry, August Wilson ne parivaar, nasl aur sapnon ki baat ki.",
  "'Miller ke 3 = All Death Crucible' (1947, 1949, 1953). Williams = 'Glass todo, Streetcar pakdo, Cat ko chhat par bithao' (1944, 1947, 1955)."),
 ("Theatre of the Absurd",
  "Do world wars ke baad logon ko laga zindagi ka koi matlab hi nahi. Absurd theatre yahi dikhata hai: kahani aage nahi badhti, baatein bekaar lagti hain. Waiting for Godot mein do aadmi ek ped ke paas Godot ka intezaar karte hain jo kabhi nahi aata, jaise bus stop par aisi bus ka intezaar jo route par hai hi nahi. Ionesco ke Rhinoceros mein sab log gainda ban jaate hain. Martin Esslin ne 1961 mein is theatre ko ye naam diya. Iski philosophy Camus ki Myth of Sisyphus se aati hai.",
  "Godot ke log 'V-E-P-L': Vladimir, Estragon, Pozzo, Lucky. Endgame mein 'Hamm aur Clov, mummy-papa dustbin mein' (Nagg, Nell)."),
 ("European and World Drama",
  "Norway ke Ibsen ko modern drama ka pita kehte hain - A Doll's House mein Nora darwaza patak kar ghar chhod deti hai. Strindberg aur Chekhov ne mann ke andar ki ulajhan dikhayi. Chekhov ki Cherry Orchard mein ek purana parivaar apna baag kho deta hai, jaise purani haveli bik jaye. Brecht chahta tha ki darshak roye nahi, sochein - isliye epic theatre aur alienation effect. Africa se Soyinka aur Fugard, Caribbean se Walcott ne apni zameen ki kahaniyan di.",
  "Ibsen ka order 'Peer, Doll, Ghost, Duck, Hedda' (1867-1890). Chekhov ke 4: 'Seagull Uncle ki Teen Behnon ka Cherry Orchard'."),
 ("Indian Drama (Classical and Indian English)",
  "Bharat mein natak bahut purana hai - Bharata ka Natyashastra rasa theory deta hai, jaise khane ke swaad ki tarah natak ke bhi 'ras' hote hain. Kalidasa ka Shakuntala duniya bhar mein mashhoor hua jab William Jones ne 1789 mein uska anuvaad kiya. Aaj ke daur mein Karnad ne itihas aur lok-kathaon se Tughlaq aur Hayavadana likhe. Tendulkar ne Marathi mein samaaj ki hinsa dikhayi, Badal Sircar ne sadak par 'Third Theatre' kiya. Mahesh Dattani ne English mein ghar-parivaar aur gender ke chhupe sawal uthaye.",
  "Karnad ka order 'Y-T-H-N' = Yayati 1961, Tughlaq 1964, Hayavadana 1971, Naga-Mandala 1988 - 'Yaar Tum Hamesha Nach'te ho'. Dattani = 'Dance, Tara, Final' (1989-90-93)."),
 ("Dramatic Theory and Criticism",
  "Natak kaise likha aur dekha jaye, is par bahut se logon ne niyam banaye. Sidney aur baad ke classical log 'unities' (ek kahani, ek jagah, ek din) chahte the. Dryden ne apne essay mein char doston ki bahas dikhayi, aur Johnson ne kaha darshak bewakoof nahi hain, wo jaante hain stage sirf stage hai. Freytag ne kahani ka pyramid banaya, jaise pahad par chadhna aur utarna. 20vi sadi mein Artaud, Grotowski, Brook aur Boal ne naye theatre ke ideas diye.",
  "'Artaud = Atyachar (Cruelty), Grotowski = Gareeb (Poor), Brook = Bare Khali Space (Empty Space), Boal = Bechare Oppressed'."),
]
